      "releaseNotes": "-Bug fixes, including:\n\n•⁠  ⁠Correct retrieval of videos stored in iCloud.\n\n•⁠  ⁠Accurate assignment of frames-per-second (FPS) to imported videos.\n\n•⁠  ⁠Additional minor performance and stability improvements.\n\n-Updated compatibility with the latest iPhone and iPad devices and optimized support for the newest iOS versions.\n\n-New Kinogram feature: Automatically detects athlete silhouette using Artificial Intelligence (AI).\n\nThank you for using MySprint! \n\nWe continue working hard to offer you the best user experience.",
